caption: Numerical Mastery

Jutsu — Tier 2: 100 character points after modifiers invested in the mastered institutional tree. Purchased Jutsu and qualifying Tree Advantages assigned to that tree count; attributes, Talents, governing traits, and any other exclusions defined by the Tradition do not. A purchased trait's points may count toward only one institutional tree. Potence or equivalent governing trait 4; at least one Jutsu with minimum Potence 4 or higher; preserve foundational-node, consequential-use, and tree-specific demonstration requirements.
